From f11c2574b44a0754b06c2b85ed473d26cf276454 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Nepomuceno Marcos <me@diegonmarcos.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Jun 2026 21:52:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] comms: full-screen FragmentJmapAccount + fix missing-folders
 crash

Replaces the MVP dialog with a proper full-screen account editor that
mirrors FragmentAccount/FragmentPop for TYPE_JMAP accounts.

Changes:
- FragmentJmapAccount: full-screen Fragment with Identity / Credentials /
  Server sections. Password field uses Material TextInputLayout
  endIconMode=password_toggle (eye icon). Handles create + edit mode.
  Edit mode pre-fills all fields from DB including the stored password.
- fragment_jmap_account.xml: layout matching FairEmail account setup style.
- CommsAccounts.ensureJmapFolders: creates INBOX/Sent/Drafts/Trash/Junk
  placeholder folders if missing. Called on both create and edit so existing
  accounts get folders retroactively (fixes 'folder missing' error).
- ActivitySetup.ACTION_ADD_JMAP receiver: navigates to FragmentJmapAccount
  instead of showing FragmentDialogJmap dialog.
- ActivitySetup.onEditAccount TYPE_JMAP: navigates to FragmentJmapAccount
  (edit mode) instead of dialog.
